Source: halos-desktop-branding
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Matti Airas <matti.airas@hatlabs.fi>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/halos-org/halos-desktop-branding
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: halos-desktop-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         rpd-common
Provides: halos-desktop-wallpaper
Conflicts: halos-desktop-wallpaper
Replaces: halos-desktop-wallpaper
Description: HaLOS branded default desktop wallpaper
 This package provides the HaLOS-branded default desktop wallpaper for
 HaLOS desktop variants, overriding the upstream Raspberry Pi OS default
 (shipped via the rpd-common package) using dpkg-divert on the pcmanfm
 system-wide desktop-items conffiles. Per-user wallpaper choices take
 precedence over this default.
 .
 Exclusivity with HALPI2-specific branding is enforced via the virtual
 package halos-desktop-wallpaper: only one provider can be installed
 at a time.
